msgid "gemspec development dependency example"
msgstr ""

#: ../../peps/peps/pep-0735.rst:1108
msgid ""
"Consider the following simple project in the form of a ``Gemfile`` and ``."
"gemspec``. The ``cool-gem.gemspec`` file:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../peps/peps/pep-0735.rst:1126
